  "concierge": {
    "$comment": "Robi concierge (owner order of 2026-10-27): a customer who proves an email with a one-time code gets a short session in which Robi can fix that customer's own account. Refund rules are the owner's exact ones and are in the Terms: a refund is refused when ALL ran more than max_actions_in_window actions in the refund window (monthly: the 3 days since the charge; lifetime: the 5 days since purchase). Not provisional: the owner set the number.",
